Package: DeepCSCN
Type: Package
Title: Deep Learning for Cell-Type-Specific Gene Co-Expression Networks
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yuting", "Bai", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yutingya820@gmail.com")
Author: Yuting Bai [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yuting Bai <yutingya820@gmail.com>
Description: Infers cell-type-specific gene co-expression networks from
    single-cell and spatial transcriptomic data. The package calls a bundled
    Python and PyTorch implementation of the GeneCluster convolutional neural
    network, spatial pyramid pooling, and DeepCluster training workflow through
    'reticulate', then provides R functions for cell-type-specific feature,
    module, and functional analyses.
